    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2023-agential-10: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.53";
    dc:description "The decomposition can be operationalized quantitatively and tested on selected systems. Existing repositories contain fragments of the required mapping, not broad matched datasets, so the general mechanism is only partially resolvable.";
